******************************************************************************************
* INPUT FILES                                                                            *
******************************************************************************************
data.dat                       :: File of resistance measurements
datasets.txt                   :: File of dataset associations
******************************************************************************************
* OUTPUT FILES                                                                           *
******************************************************************************************
data_err.dat                   :: File of resistances with added noise
uncertainties.dat              :: File of Gaussian noise
******************************************************************************************
* NOISE PARAMETERS                                                                       *
******************************************************************************************
1                              :: Noise type (0=fixed, 1=resistance, 2=percentage)
51                             :: Random seed
1                              :: Number of datasets
0.02   0.1                     :: Noise: [sigma], [a b] or [%] (one line per dataset)
******************************************************************************************